        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pixel-art 2D action game focused on hardcore combat and mythological storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Combat Experience</strong>: Every enemy has a unique attack rhythm. Observe, dodge, and counter to experience the thrill of strategic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/6fda05d6df6487f3a9296ed5d3b2421b.poster.avif?t=1779852318\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/6fda05d6df6487f3a9296ed5d3b2421b.webm?t=1779852318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/6fda05d6df6487f3a9296ed5d3b2421b.mp4?t=1779852318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Mythical World</strong>: Every frame of pixel art is hand-drawn by the developer. Inspired by the Classic of Mountains and Seas and Chinese mythological aesthetics, the game reconstructs a desolate, eerie, and magnificent fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/80a6df7eecda13d67ce8545832f95bba.poster.avif?t=1779852318\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/80a6df7eecda13d67ce8545832f95bba.webm?t=1779852318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/80a6df7eecda13d67ce8545832f95bba.mp4?t=1779852318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Forward Path</strong>: A linear narrative built through side-scrolling level design. There is no getting lost—only fighting your way to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/b09c1dab16777e03111263667c8207bb.poster.avif?t=1779852318\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/b09c1dab16777e03111263667c8207bb.webm?t=1779852318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/b09c1dab16777e03111263667c8207bb.mp4?t=1779852318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Concise and Impactful Experience</strong>: No meaningless padding or grinding. In 2–3 hours of intense immersion, the game tells a complete story about obsession and the search for self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>                                                                                                                                                                                                </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Word from the Developer</strong>：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first solo-developed project. While it may not be perfect, I have spent several years refining its gameplay feel, environments, story, and artistic details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy this kind of hardcore action game, even a simple review would mean a great deal to me and help me keep going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pixel-art 2D action game focused on hardcore combat and mythological storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Combat Experience</strong>: Every enemy has a unique attack rhythm. Observe, dodge, and counter to experience the thrill of strategic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/6fda05d6df6487f3a9296ed5d3b2421b.poster.avif?t=1779852318\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/6fda05d6df6487f3a9296ed5d3b2421b.webm?t=1779852318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/6fda05d6df6487f3a9296ed5d3b2421b.mp4?t=1779852318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Mythical World</strong>: Every frame of pixel art is hand-drawn by the developer. Inspired by the Classic of Mountains and Seas and Chinese mythological aesthetics, the game reconstructs a desolate, eerie, and magnificent fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/80a6df7eecda13d67ce8545832f95bba.poster.avif?t=1779852318\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/80a6df7eecda13d67ce8545832f95bba.webm?t=1779852318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/80a6df7eecda13d67ce8545832f95bba.mp4?t=1779852318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Forward Path</strong>: A linear narrative built through side-scrolling level design. There is no getting lost—only fighting your way to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/b09c1dab16777e03111263667c8207bb.poster.avif?t=1779852318\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/b09c1dab16777e03111263667c8207bb.webm?t=1779852318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794560/extras/b09c1dab16777e03111263667c8207bb.mp4?t=1779852318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Concise and Impactful Experience</strong>: No meaningless padding or grinding. In 2–3 hours of intense immersion, the game tells a complete story about obsession and the search for self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>                                                                                                                                                                                                </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Word from the Developer</strong>：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first solo-developed project. While it may not be perfect, I have spent several years refining its gameplay feel, environments, story, and artistic details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy this kind of hardcore action game, even a simple review would mean a great deal to me and help me keep going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
